# ── Monorepo-wide safety net ───────────────────────────────
# Each app (DuForgeMakhana-Admin/Backend/Customer) has its own .gitignore;
# these patterns are a defense-in-depth backstop so nothing sensitive or
# heavy is ever committed from anywhere in the tree.

# Dependencies
**/node_modules/
**/.pnp
**/.pnp.*

# Environment / secrets — never commit real env files
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Build outputs
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/build/

# Caches
**/.cache/
**/.vite/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Logs
**/*.log
**/logs/

# Keys / certs
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.ssh/
**/serviceAccountKey.json

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

# Deploy artifacts
**/.vercel
